  "description": "Step back in time with KIRON, an ornate Tuscan serif display font that captures the bold grit and decorative grandeur of vintage Western typography! Featuring distinct bifurcated (fishtail) serifs, curved mid-stem spurs, and heavy, authoritative block proportions, KIRON brings an immediate old-world charm and visual impact to your headlines. \nWhether you’re crafting saloon-style signage, craft beer labels, vintage whiskey branding, circus or rodeo posters, western book titles, or custom vinyl and laser craft SVG designs, KIRON delivers a time-tested look that stands out with bold character!",
